@HelpdeskAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7049

### Register
POST {{HelpdeskAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo.user",
  "displayName": "Demo User",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demopass1234"
}

### Login
POST {{HelpdeskAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "agent1",
  "password": "Agentpass123"
}

### List tickets (search and filter)
GET {{HelpdeskAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=Open
Accept: application/json

### Create ticket (needs X-CSRF-TOKEN from /api/antiforgery/token)
POST {{HelpdeskAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <token>

{
  "title": "Printer offline on floor 2",
  "description": "HP printer shows offline since the morning shift",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "channel": "Web"
}

### Dashboard stats
GET {{HelpdeskAPI_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/stats
Accept: application/json

### SLA policies
GET {{HelpdeskAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sla/policies
Accept: application/json

###
